WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.100
Hi there! In this video, I'll show you
Sailfish OS on miatoll.

00:00:06.850 --> 00:00:12.950
Jolla developed Sailfish OS back in 2014

00:00:13.840 --> 00:00:16.550
as an alternative to Android.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:24.560
Let's take a look
at the Redmi Note 9 Pro.

00:00:25.820 --> 00:00:29.050
Almost everything works, with
a couple of exceptions.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:35.450
Receiving SMS and Alien Dalvik.

00:00:35.450 --> 00:00:40.920
Alien Dalvik lets you run Android apps
on Sailfish OS.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:47.250
I couldn't debug it because it's
proprietary and requires a paid license.

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:51.750
You can use Waydroid instead.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:56.420
I prefer dual boot,
which also works.

00:00:56.420 --> 00:00:59.600
There are a few minor issues.

00:01:02.880 --> 00:01:06.900
An encryption bug can leave you
with a white screen.

00:01:06.900 --> 00:01:09.130
You have to force a reboot.

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:15.800
There are also Bluetooth issues.

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.050
Sometimes it turns itself off
and back on.

00:01:20.300 --> 00:01:22.050
And that's all.

00:01:22.710 --> 00:01:27.900
Encryption, device lock
and fingerprint recognition.

00:01:28.580 --> 00:01:32.320
The SD card too.
Everything seems to work.

00:01:32.670 --> 00:01:38.550
You might still run into bugs
from time to time.

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:40.780
Atmospheres.

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:50.660
The Sailfish OS features work.

00:01:51.230 --> 00:01:52.750
The Telegram client.

00:01:54.120 --> 00:01:55.740
The browser.

00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:18.720
What else do we have here? Maps.

00:02:19.980 --> 00:02:24.250
A QR scanner, Device Info,
and the camera.

00:02:26.160 --> 00:02:33.150
The camera works too,
including the extra lenses.

00:02:35.250 --> 00:02:39.580
This entry is a duplicate
of the main camera.

00:02:40.050 --> 00:02:44.100
Leave the camera with the warning
disabled.

00:02:44.100 --> 00:02:50.850
If you enable it, the camera app
will crash and need a data reset.

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:54.000
I don't know how to do that.

00:02:54.050 --> 00:02:58.950
Leave that camera disabled.
It doesn't work.

00:02:59.800 --> 00:03:02.000
That's all.
